strings.why.rule.f:
Needs ÷ income, wants ÷ income, savings ÷ income
income = {income}
needs = {needs}
wants = {wants}
savings = income − needs − wants = {savings}

strings.why.emergency.f:
Months covered = cash on hand ÷ monthly essential spending
= {liquid} ÷ {ess}
= {months} months

strings.why.dti.f:
Debt-to-income = monthly debt payments ÷ gross monthly income
= {debt} ÷ {gross}
= {result}

strings.why.housing.f:
Housing ratio = monthly housing cost ÷ gross monthly income
= {housing} ÷ {gross}
= {result}

strings.why.safe.f:
Safe to spend per day = (cash + income still due − bills still due) ÷ days left
= ({cash} + {inc} − {bills}) ÷ {days}
= {result}

